-- Design Tools v162: Real cables in the panel room – each routed from its panel down into the trench, along it and up into the next panel or out through a wall sleeve at its real diameter and bending radius, tagged and tappable in Walk inside; trenches sized to the standards (spacing, ladder tiers, standard widths, rise and corners) – suggested, applied automatically or edited in 3D or on the plan; the grouping on the ladder (IEC 60364-5-52 B.52.20) goes into the cable sizing
insert into public.design_tool_engine (version, html, created_at) values ('v162', $dtengine$<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
