      <p style="margin-top:14px;font-size:11px">${K.lines.length} line${K.lines.length === 1 ? '' : 's'}${(K.areas ?? []).length > 1 ? ` in ${K.areas.length} areas` : ''} · ${K.lines.reduce((t2, L) => t2 + L.devs.length, 0)} bus devices · ${K.gaRows.length} group addresses · ≈ ${K.cableM} m bus cable · coupling: ${KNX.coupling === 'tp' ? 'TP line couplers' : 'IP routers'}${KNX.byOthers ? ' · electrical installation by others' : ''}.</p></div>`, side('<h4>Issue</h4><p style="margin:0">For approval. The ETS project is made from these documents; the group addresses also come as a CSV for ETS import.</p>') + basis, 'KNX design pack – cover and contents', 'DES-KNX-000');
  }
