    <span><b>Floodlights re-aimed: ${fmt(s.aimed)} of ${fmt(s.n1)}</b> · ${fmt(s.mv)} aiming moves tried by the optimiser · floodlights ${fmt(s.n0)} → ${fmt(s.n1)}${d ? ` (${d > 0 ? '+' : ''}${fmt(d)})` : ''}</span></div>`; }

