function bld2() { return `<p class="note" style="margin:0 0 8px">Each HM panel room has an incoming panel fed from the main panel room. Add the panels it needs – usually one driver panel per mast (drivers in the room) – and remove the ones it does not. Panels that still feed masts are kept until the masts are moved in step 3.</p>
